<title>DENMARK: Norway's Statkraft ups 4 pct bond to 800 mln DKK.</title>
<headline>Norway's Statkraft ups 4 pct bond to 800 mln DKK.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statkraft SF on Wednesday raised a four percent six year bond offer announced earlier to 800 million crowns from 600 million, lead manager Den Danske Bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The bond was originally offered in the amount of 400 million crowns but the offer, to be listed on the Copenhagen bourse on December 5, was last Monday increased to 600 million.</p>
<p>--Steve Weizman, Copenhagen newsroom +45 33969650</p>
